 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Invite them to a game night. There are plenty of classic titles available on consoles that they'll enjoy. Great idea. Start each page with photo and ask him to give each one a name. Do they eat meat? If so, get a roast beef with all the mushrooms. Then think of the ones they don't say no to, and get those. Peel and cut everything first, so all they have to do is heat it. Stick a box of chocolate cherries in the cupboard. They' cheap right now, and everyone loves them.",
